  "description": "Durable, CRDT-backed tenant registry add-on for Orleans.Lattice. Persists tenant definitions (status, quotas, burst, placement binding, tenant-admin subjects, and cross-tenant grants) in reserved sys-tenant-* Lattice trees under system-origin, converging concurrent updates with LWW-register semantics, and fails fast at startup when tenancy is enabled without the auth and membership add-ons it depends on.",
